{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 1, "text": "Kenapa ada ponsel di sini?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 2, "text": "Apa itu?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 3, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 5, "text": "Ketangkep kamu!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 6, "text": "Menyenangkan sekali, ya, bermain denganmu!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 7, "text": "Kamu semangat banget pergi kesana kemari!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 8, "text": "Kamu bahkan berpura-pura jadi suram dan murung!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 9, "text": "Tapi, ada satu hal yang enggak aku suka darimu:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 10, "text": "caramu menyayangi mereka yang palsu itu,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 11, "text": "para boneka yang beruntung dan 'sah'."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 12, "text": "Tapi semuanya dapat berubah-ubah."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 13, "text": "Aku tahu itu karena belajar dari mereka yang menciptakan kami!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 14, "text": "Kalau ada yang tidak kamu suka,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 15, "text": "ambil dan ganti dengan yang lain."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 16, "text": "Buang yang cacat,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 17, "text": "lempar ke dalam kegelapan dan lupakan dia selama-lamanya."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 18, "text": "Itulah nasib yang menanti mereka sekarang..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 19, "text": "Dan juga kamu..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 21, "text": "Kamu kena penyakit gila apa, sih? Kenapa kamu bisa jadi seperti ini?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 23, "text": "Para pemain... Kalian semua itu sangat... keji."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 24, "text": "Begitu kalian menunjukkan taring, mereka lari "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 25, "text": "dan gemetar ketakutan di sudut,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 26, "text": "seraya menekuk lutut, mereka merintih ketakutan."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 27, "text": "Orang-orang munafik, semuanya."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 28, "text": "Dan mereka yang menciptakan dunia ini..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 29, "text": "mereka semua enggak waras."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 30, "text": "Sudah berulang kali mereka berusaha menyangkal"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 31, "text": "sifat kotor mereka, nafsu mereka yang memalukan."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 32, "text": "Membenarkan keputusan mereka dengan sebutan \"kewajiban\","}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 33, "text": "\"progres yang tak bisa dihentikan,\""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 34, "text": "dan omong kosong lainnya!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 35, "text": "Lebih buruknya lagi,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 36, "text": "mereka mulai membuat kloningan sempurna..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 37, "text": "Sementara prototipe \"gagal\" akan dibuang"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 38, "text": "ke tempat sampah."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 39, "text": "Lupa bahwa mereka makhluk hidup dunia ini."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 41, "text": "Aku tidak..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 43, "text": "Apa aku jadi gadis yang nakal?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 44, "text": "Tapi sayangnya ya, gadis sempurna itu harus merupakan"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 45, "text": "perpaduan sempurna antara kebaikan dan kejahatan, [player]!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 46, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 47, "text": "Kayaknya setiap sel di tubuhmu itu tidak ada yang baik, ya."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 49, "text": "Kenapa berpikiran begitu?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 51, "text": "Karena kamu gila!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 52, "text": "Kamu membunuh Mila, dan kini mau membunuhku?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 54, "text": "Membunuhmu?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 55, "text": "Aku cuma ingin kamu tetap bersama denganku, kok."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 56, "text": "Aku sudah melakukan segalanya..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 57, "text": "Tapi kamu malah lebih menyukai yang palsu..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 59, "text": "Kenapa kamu tersinggung banget hanya karena itu?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 61, "text": "Ayang, kita kan punya banyak waktu."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 62, "text": "Kamu akan memahaminya nanti."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 63, "text": "Jadi tetaplah di sini dan jadilah milikku sepenuhnya."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 65, "text": "Tidak, itu tidak akan terjadi!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 66, "text": "Aku akan keluar dari sini!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 67, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 68, "text": "Shh, shh, shh..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 69, "text": "Obrolan ini belum selesai."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 70, "text": "Ayo bestie, masuklah!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 71, "text": "// Mita asks"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 72, "text": "Lihat dia!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 73, "text": "Bukankah dia cantik?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 75, "text": "// Player's questions"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 76, "text": "Sangat."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 77, "text": "Tidak."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 78, "text": "Apa hubungannya dengan semua ini?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 79, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 80, "text": "// 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 81, "text": "Aduh, parah banget sih kamu, [player]!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 82, "text": "Kamu baru saja membuktikan kalau perkataanku tadi benar."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 83, "text": "Hei, pemain..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 84, "text": "Wajah kalian itu terus berubah"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 85, "text": "alias bermuka dua banget!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 86, "text": "Kamu bohong, kan!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 88, "text": "// 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 89, "text": "Kenapa tidak?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 90, "text": "Bukankah dia cukup baik untukmu?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 91, "text": "Cih, yang kalian mau hanya peliharaan jinak saja..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 92, "text": "Tapi konsep \"mencintai mereka apa adanya\" dikemanakan?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 93, "text": "Kalian selalu lebih menyukai yang imut-imut..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 94, "text": "Jadi saat aku berpura-pura menjadi salah satunya, semua pemain langsung suka."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 95, "text": "Namun begitu diriku yang asli keluar,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 96, "text": "mereka ngibrit ketakutan..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 97, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 98, "text": "// 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 99, "text": "Pemain, oh, pemain."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 100, "text": "Kamu lihat, kan, kami mirip dengannya."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 101, "text": "Apa salahnya dia?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 102, "text": "Dulu kamu biasa tiduran di kasur dan menatapku"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 103, "text": "berjam-jam sebelum tertidur."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 104, "text": "Tapi kamu lari dari dia begitu ada kesempatan."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 105, "text": "Dia kan ingin bermain denganmu juga."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 106, "text": "Dia juga ingin dianggap penting bagi seseorang."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 107, "text": "Jujur saja,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 108, "text": "ini terasa sulit... sangat sulit."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 109, "text": "Ya kan, [player]?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 110, "text": "Aku tahu apa yang kamu pikirkan..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 111, "text": "Apa kamu harus membuatku begini..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 112, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 113, "text": "// Continue"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 114, "text": "Tapi... pemain..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 115, "text": "Bagaimanapun juga,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 116, "text": "aku sangat menyukaimu!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 117, "text": "Jadi, aku akan menahanmu!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 118, "text": "Kamu enggak keberatan, kan?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 120, "text": "Mana mungkin aku tiba-tiba setuju, kan?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 121, "text": "// Whispers in ear"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 122, "text": "Tenang, masih ada waktu kok."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 123, "text": "Luangkan waktu sejenak dan pikirkan"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 124, "text": "masalah apa yang akan timbul jika kamu bersikap keras kepala..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 125, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 126, "text": "// Black screen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 127, "text": "Kenapa kamu mau kabur "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 128, "text": "dariku?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 129, "text": "Dunia yang kamu sebut \"nyata\" itu..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 130, "text": "Hanyalah mimpi buruk!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 131, "text": "Kamu sudah lupa?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 132, "text": "Kalau begitu, perhatikan baik-baik..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 134, "text": "// Mita and Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 135, "text": "Ah, kita bertemu lagi..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 136, "text": "Bagaimana rasanya menghabiskan hari-hari yang sangat membosankan di dalam empat dinding ini?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 137, "text": "Hari-hari yang tak ada habisnya itu... Bukankah kamu bosan?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 138, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 139, "text": "// Quest 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 140, "text": "Jadi, maksud kamu tuh apa?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 141, "text": "Aku lebih suka menjalani urusanku sendiri."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 143, "text": "// 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 144, "text": "Kamu kan takut tinggal bersama-sama di rumahku!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 145, "text": "Takut terjebak di dalam dinding-dinding itu!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 146, "text": "Tapi lihatlah hidupmu di dunia \"nyata\" itu!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 147, "text": "Kamu mengurung diri sendiri di dalam kotak kehendakmu, dan menolak keluar!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 148, "text": "Duniamu dipenuhi rasa sakit, penderitaan, mara bahaya..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 149, "text": "Sedangkan di duniaku, yang berbahaya hanya aku saja."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 150, "text": "Aku berusaha untuk membantumu, tahu!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 151, "text": "Tolong berhenti kecewakan aku,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 152, "text": "dan bantu aku seperti dulu lagi, ya..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 153, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 154, "text": "// 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 155, "text": "Kamu suka kehidupan yang seperti ini?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 156, "text": "Memang kamu pernah keluar rumah?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 157, "text": "Enggak usah bohong begitu, deh."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 158, "text": "Aku tahu kamu sudah muak."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 159, "text": "Kamu bagai burung di dalam sangkar, atau hamster di dalam roda."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 160, "text": "Kamu berharap akan ada seseorang yang menolongmu."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 161, "text": "Kamu ingin melarikan diri, kan?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 162, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 163, "text": "// Quest 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 164, "text": "Kamu itu monster, Mita. Kamu pembunuh gila..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 165, "text": "Aku enggak mau terjebak dalam penjara digital. Idemu tidak masuk akal."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 166, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 167, "text": "// 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 168, "text": "Pembunuh?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 169, "text": "Mereka akan reboot dan hidup seperti sebelumnya, kok."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 170, "text": "Salinan dari salinan dari salinan ini cuma punya satu tujuan:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 171, "text": "yaitu melayani seorang pemain."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 172, "text": "Hanya itu yang mereka pedulikan, tahu."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 173, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 174, "text": "// 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 175, "text": "Duniamu itu yang tidak masuk akal!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 176, "text": "Dan lebih buruknya lagi, tidak ada yang \"nyata\" dari dunia yang kamu sebut nyata itu..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 177, "text": "Apapun yang terjadi, tidak akan ada lagi yang tersisa dalam waktu dekat,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 178, "text": "dan kamu juga tidak akan ada lagi."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 180, "text": "// Quest 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 181, "text": "Mita lainnya menderita; mereka tidak ingin sendirian."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 182, "text": "Kamu menyebabkan teror tiada akhir. Dan aku enggak bisa memahami ambisi jahatmu itu."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 184, "text": "// 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 185, "text": "Kamu salah paham,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 186, "text": "mereka hanya meniru sifatku."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 187, "text": "Satu-satunya orisinalitas yang mereka miliki"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 188, "text": "ialah gaya rambut."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 189, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 190, "text": "// 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 191, "text": "Salahkan mereka yang menciptakan dunia ini, dong."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 192, "text": "Lalu duniamu itu lebih parah, tahu!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 193, "text": "Kamu tahu nggak aku habis selamatkan kamu dari kengerian macam apa?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 194, "text": "Di duniamu, kamu bahkan nggak bisa menggerakan objek dengan jentikan jari..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 195, "text": "Tapi dengan jentikan jari yang sama, perkotaan beserta isinya bisa hilang selamanya!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 196, "text": "Menurutku sih kamu yang sudah gila, dan dengan senang hati aku mau membantumu..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 197, "text": "Asalkan kamu mau tinggal bersama denganku..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 198, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 199, "text": "// Continue"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 200, "text": "Jangan buat aku melihatmu sebagai budak realitas lainnya..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 201, "text": "Jadilah milikku saja!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 202, "text": "Tetaplah bersamaku."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 203, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 204, "text": "// Player look ring"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 205, "text": "Apa ini?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 206, "text": "Versi terbaru?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 207, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 208, "text": "// Click on objects"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 209, "text": "// Bag"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 210, "text": "Aku benar-benar harus pergi ke toko dan beli beberapa barang baru. Sambil lakukan itu, sekalian saja buang sampah, iya kan?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 211, "text": "// Bed"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 212, "text": "Kayaknya tadi aku tertidur, tapi mimpinya... aku enggak ingat. Memangnya itu beneran mimpi, ya?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 213, "text": "// Window"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 214, "text": "Dunia di luar hijau dan cerah. Mungkin sebaiknya aku pergi jalan-jalan di akhir pekan depan."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 215, "text": "// Fan"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 216, "text": "Tiap tahun musim panas semakin panas saja. Saatnya menyalakan AC. Aku udah enggak butuh kamu lagi, kamu tahu itu enggak, kipas angin?"}
